    "answer": "## 回答\n原文依据：To explore model scalability, we use the ILSVRC-2012 ImageNet dataset with 1k classes and 1.3M images (we refer to it as ImageNet in what follows), its superset ImageNet-21k with 21k classes and 14M images (Deng et al., 2009), and JFT (Sun et al., 2017) with 18k classes and 303M high-resolution images. [参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\n\nImageNet 数据集包含 1000 个类别和 130 万张图像。[参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\nImageNet-21k 数据集包含 21000 个类别和 1400 万张图像。[参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\nJFT 数据集包含 18000 个类别和 30300 万张高分辨率图像。[参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\n\n## 参考来源\n- [参考文档4] Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）",
